ng the ornament arrangement, including a gold flower toward the upper left. They are separate generated illustrations.\n\n## Validation\n\nAll 30 source images and WebPs have an alpha channel. Final alpha ranges include both 0 and 255. Each final asset is square at 1024 pixels; the SVGs embed their corresponding WebPs without external references. The contact sheet was visually inspected for correct glyphs, consistent style, and unclipped artwork.\n`;
